  "description": "In the Early Era, the Creator gave man a mission to eliminate all the ‘unclean’ entities that existed in the world. The man confessed to the Creator that he couldn’t complete the mission on his own and asked for help. In response, the Creator sent 13 people, including ‘Ragnir’ to help. They were called ‘The First Shura’ and they would work to fulfill the Creator’s mission together. That is until a huge war breaks out between the ancient creatures and the Shura, whom they fear. Thus begins the ‘Discord’ and the ‘Birth of Malice’.",
